# Daily work layout — 4 tabs, SW-couriers stack, auto-starting dev servers.
# Launch: kitty --session ~/.config/kitty/work.session  (or super+shift+w / Xephyr startup)
#
# Each tab runs its command then `exec zsh`, so Ctrl+C stops the server but the
# tab stays open for reuse. To make a tab NOT auto-run, replace the whole
# `launch ... zsh -c '...'` line with just:  launch --cwd=<folder>
